{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17934","headline":"秋怀诗十一首 七 · 韩愈","name":"秋怀诗十一首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋夜不可晨，秋日苦易暗。\n我无汲汲志，何以有此憾。\n寒鸡空在栖，缺月烦屡瞰。\n有琴具徽弦，再鼓听愈淡。\n古声久埋灭，无由见真滥。\n低心逐时趋，苦勉祗能暂。\n有如乘风船，一纵不可缆。\n不如覰文字，丹铅事点勘。\n岂必求赢余，所要石与甔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}